/-!
# A124258

Triangle whose rows are sequences of increasing and decreasing squares: 1; 1,4,1; 1,4,9,4,1; ...

The 85 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A124258

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 1, 4, 1, 1, 4, 9, 4, 1, 1,
    4, 9, 16, 9, 4, 1, 1, 4, 9, 16,
    25, 16, 9, 4, 1, 1, 4, 9, 16, 25,
    36, 25, 16, 9, 4, 1, 1, 4, 9, 16,
    25, 36, 49, 36, 25, 16, 9, 4, 1, 1,
